                "text": "<p>If you want the bracelets in your jewelry collection to pair well with everything in your closet and be the perfect accessories for years to come, you need to invest in designs that are always in style.</p><p>To help you narrow down your options and build the ultimate bracelet collection that will stand the test, here are some of the most timeless bracelet designs that are perfect for every occasion.</p>",
