    "multiple_text_with_image_DFzq4D": {
      "type": "multiple-text-with-image",
      "blocks": {
        "item_bt4mE3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ulti-1.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Tennis Bracelets",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Arguably the most iconic bracelet design of all time, these timeless statement pieces are must-have accessories. <a href=\"/collections/bracelets/Tennis\" title=\"/collections/bracelets/Tennis\">Diamond tennis bracelets</a> instantly add a touch of elegance to any outfit, and you can wear them with anything from jeans to gowns.</p><p>Not to mention, these beautiful accessories pair well with every piece in your jewelry box. No matter the occasion, tennis bracelets are always the perfect accessories.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_NQqpM6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ulti-2.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Diamond Bracelets",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Although tennis bracelets have almost become synonymous with <a href=\"/collections/bracelets?grid-mobile=default&filter.p.m.custom.style=Diamond&filter.v.price.gte=0&filter.v.price.lte=29995&sort_by=manual\" title=\"/collections/bracelets?grid-mobile=default&filter.p.m.custom.style=Diamond&filter.v.price.gte=0&filter.v.price.lte=29995&sort_by=manual\">diamond bracelets</a> as a whole, there are countless other diamond bracelet designs for you to choose from besides the iconic tennis bracelet.</p><p>So, if you want to mix things up in your jewelry box, create a timeless collection of diamond bracelets with unique designs, such as diamond cuffs, bangles, and station bracelets.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_6wjULK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ulti-3.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Chain Bracelets",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p><a href=\"/collections/bracelets\" title=\"/collections/bracelets\">Chain bracelets</a> are essential pieces in any jewelry collection - and it’s easy to see why. These versatile bracelets are always in vogue, and instantly make any outfit look incredibly stylish.</p><p>You can wear a dainty chain link for a minimalist look, stick to a single oversized chain bracelet as the focal eye-catching accessory, or layer bracelets of different widths and precious metals for the ultimate fashion statement.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_LzYdCQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ulti-4.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Bangles",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Whether you prefer bold or delicate <a href=\"/collections/bracelets\" title=\"/collections/bracelets\">bangles</a>, there’s no denying that these solid bracelets always pack a punch. Designs can vary from minimalist to extravagant, so, no matter the occasion, there’s always the perfect bangle for it.</p><p>Whether you prefer to wear your bangles stacked or by themselves, you just can’t go wrong with these beautiful bracelets.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_8WTAtP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ulti-5.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Gold Bracelets",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>No matter which bracelet design has your heart, the truth is that <a href=\"/collections/bracelets\" title=\"/collections/bracelets\">gold bracelets</a> are simply timeless. Whether you prefer gold chain bracelets, bangles, diamond bracelets, or any other design, you just can never go wrong with gold bracelets.</p><p>From bold designs to minimalist styles, these bracelets are all you need to add the perfect finishing touches to any outfit.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        }
      },
