    "bracelets_styles_LrLbaG": {
      "type": "bracelets-styles",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_XEYDLg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Stick to a metal, but mix styles",
            "text": "<p>An easy way of creating a harmonious bracelet stack is to opt for a single precious metal and make a statement by layering bangles, chains, diamond bracelets, and more. No matter which designs you choose, just make sure to stick to the same metal color and let your creativity run wild.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_HrMFVF": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Stick to a design, but mix metals",
            "text": "<p>If you prefer, you can also go in the opposite direction and layer multiple bracelets of the same style, but in different metal colors. You can stack three bangles, one in each shade of gold; wear a yellow gold tennis bracelet with a platinum one, or mix chain links of different widths, patterns, and precious metals. The sky’s the limit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_gEf8aU": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Stick to an aesthetic",
            "text": "<p>Another option is to mix and match different metals and styles. In this case, you have to make sure the bracelets should have something in common between them, so your stack looks cohesive. You can wear a tennis bracelet with a diamond bangle or go for different bracelets that feature the same gemstone. Your options are endless.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_block_XEYDLg",
        "text_block_HrMFVF",
        "text_block_gEf8aU"
      ],
      "name": "Bracelet Styles Guide",
      "settings": {
        "custom_class": "",
        "title": "How to style your bracelets",
        "description": "<p>Bracelets stacks have been all the rage lately and, although we’ve been looking into timeless bracelet designs, sometimes it’s fun to mix things up a little and try out a new trend. So, if you want to hop on the bracelet stack trend, here are some expert tips on how to stack your bracelets like a pro.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/ultimate-abnm.jpg",
        "image_position": "right"
      }
    },
